<%--
Resend_Invite_Modal_Body - body for the "Resend Invitation" modal.

Shows a ready-to-paste invitation message (company name + registration link) in a
read-only, selectable textbox so staff can drop it into an email or instant
messenger directly. The footer also offers to re-send the invite by email.

Arguments:
- $message (string, required): the full invitation message, including the link
--%>
<Define:Resend_Invite_Modal_Body tag="div">
    <p class="text-muted">
        Copy this message and send it to the contact directly, or use
        <strong>Resend Invite by Email</strong> below.
    </p>

    <textarea class="form-control" rows="3" readonly $sid="message"></textarea>
</Define:Resend_Invite_Modal_Body>
